10000                                               ! dpm_isat_max_leaves: max table capacity per rank (~145 MB at 10k)
100000                                              ! dpm_isat_stats_every: periodic stats cadence in queries (0=off, only shutdown summary)
0                                                   ! dpm_cvodes_kill: 0=CVODES BDF (baseline), 1=Phase 1 closed-form linear (rhs_mode=1 only), 2=Phase 3 Picard-iterated closed-form (replaces BDF in mode 0; ISAT-amortized), 3=Phase 4 Option D ISAT (per-particle dt-integrated cell pass)
0                                                   ! dpm_isat_step_active: 0=off, 1=on (Phase 4 Option D ISAT — separate instance for kill=3)
1.0d-3                                              ! dpm_isat_step_etol: ISAT error tolerance for the dt-integrated cell pass
2000                                                ! dpm_isat_step_max_leaves: max table capacity per rank (Phase 4b: lowered from 10000 to force LRU eviction)
100000                                              ! dpm_isat_step_stats_every: periodic stats cadence in queries (0=off)
1000                                                ! dpm_cvodes_max_steps: BDF mxstep (default 1000; was hardcoded 200)
50                                                  ! dpm_isat_warmup_ct: post-restart ISAT bypass window (default 50; 0=disabled)
0.05d0                                              ! dpm_inlet_ramp_time: linear ramp [s] for inlet spray flow; m_eff(t)=m_prescribed*min(1,t/tau); 0.0=disabled
