1.0d-3                                              ! dpm_hybrid_yl_water_thresh: Yl_water below this signals water depletion (Type 2 detection)
5.0d0                                               ! dpm_hybrid_T_margin: T_drop > T_gas + margin signals thermal runaway (Type 2 detection) [K]
.true.                                              ! dpm_absorb_geom_active: enable absorbing geometric trigger (regime 3 forced flash for cell-saturating + anomalously-grown particles)
